    LLM: 'Game: 66 German. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '66 German (Sechsundsechzig): two-player trick-taking. 24-card deck (A-10-K-Q-J-9). 6 cards each; turned card for trump. First to 66 trick points (and declare) wins the hand. Marriages (K+Q same suit) 20 or 40; close stock to force follow suit. Game to 7 match points.',
    objective: 'Be first to 66 trick points in a hand (and declare) or reach 7 match points.',
